@format 1
@id split.section-move
@title Move section
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Reorder a section and preserve its active selection.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split
@flow TB
@related shared.synchronize-sections
@tag section
@tag section-move

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Move section request <input>
- Receive the requested section change @ flow.PFlowSectionMove(...)
> guard

[guard] Check effective change <decision>
- Confirm section editing is enabled, the section exists, and the requested position differs @ flow.PFlowSectionMove(...)
? "The request changes section state" > mutate
? "The source is locked, or the request is invalid or already satisfied" > unchanged

[mutate] Change section state <process>
- Move the section to the requested list position and preserve its selection @ flow.PFlowSectionMove(...)
- Record the section change @ flow.PFlowSectionRecord(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Section state is unchanged.
